Package: evoctl
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Aleksey Khristolyubov
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, dkms, make, udev, kmod
Recommends: acl
Suggests: pulseaudio-utils
Description: Audient EVO 8 control panel for Linux
 Native PySide6 mixer and monitor-control application for Audient EVO 8.
 Includes the evo_raw DKMS helper for concurrent control while ALSA remains
 available to a DAW, plus udev and usbmon access configuration.
